      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ODEN (3) has some solid form under his belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.75 lengths at Ballarat in a handy 25.18 beating Paw Gusto. The form from his last run stacks up well. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. PAW HADES (1) finished second (25.98) two back at Warrnambool but out of the placings last time when 8th there. Shapes as one to consider. LAKEVIEW CINDY (8) has a strong record this journey here with two wins and a minor from six starts. Was out of the placings last time (26.53) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing fifth and beaten 4 lengths. Looks well placed here and among the chances. PAW ISLA (5) made it two minor placings on the trot when beaten second (25.72) in a Grade 5 FIN at Warrnambool last time out.",
